      }
    },
    "Each ray is an hour. Its length and color show how your HRV compared with your usual. Arcs on the outer ring mark sleep (violet) and workouts (orange)." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条射线代表一小时，长度和颜色表示那一小时的 HRV 与你平时相比如何。外圈的弧线标出睡眠（紫色）和训练（橙色）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each ray is one hour. Longer rays mean a higher average heart rate." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条射线代表一小时，越长表示该小时平均心率越高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each score compares that day’s median daytime SDNN with the same source’s daily medians over the prior 30 days. Lower relative HRV gives a higher score." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
