    "Estimated from heart rate readings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据心率读数估算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every reading is ranked against your own daytime HRV from the past 30 days, from the same watch. There are no population averages, so a number that is low for someone else can be normal for you." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条读数都和同一块手表记录的、你自己过去 30 天的日间 HRV 比较。不用人群平均值，所以对别人来说偏低的数字，对你可能很正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fewer than 3 days with HRV in this period, so there’s no period comparison." : {
