    "The daily score compares your daytime HRV median with daily medians from the same source over the previous 30 days. Lower HRV relative to that history gives a higher pressure estimate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每日评分将白天 HRV 中位数与同一来源此前 30 天的每日中位数比较。相对历史的 HRV 越低，压力估计值越高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The day view shows how the day went for your body. Recovery shows how well you slept it off. Training sits alongside, so you can see why." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
