            "value" : "日视图展示身体如何度过这一天；恢复展示你睡一觉后缓过来多少。训练放在旁边，帮你找到原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The estimate ranks your daytime SDNN against daily medians from the same source over the previous 30 days. Lower HRV ranks as higher relative pressure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
